{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-4768508","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【创作】2016年棱镜塔设计随笔","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一在巴黎记录密阿雷市棱镜塔的设计灵感，并为次日的日本博览会拍摄与彩排。","date":"2016-07-06","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Prism Tower","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Prism Tower","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4768508.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160708230251id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4768508.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":348,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-4768508/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/001-d39a299518.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[639,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一在巴黎记录密阿雷市棱镜塔的设计灵感，并为次日的日本博览会拍摄与彩排。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">以巴黎为主题的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">就是密阿雷市</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">位于密阿雷市正中央的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">就是棱镜塔！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">棱镜塔的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">设计灵感</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">就是这个！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/001-d39a299518.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/001-d39a299518.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n现在正值足球欧洲杯2016举办，球挂在那里了！<br>\n\n\n还有奇迹般出现的鸽子（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/002-b7ff5c1d90.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/002-b7ff5c1d90.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n第一层那里有个洞\n\n是我第一次来巴黎时了解到的事！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/003-fcd631e48c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/003-fcd631e48c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n即使不加图片特效，也会展现出各种表情！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n没错！\n埃菲尔铁塔！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n以香水瓶为灵感\n打造一座\n美丽\n柔美\n熠熠生辉的\n美丽高塔！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n我提出了这样的要求\n请设计师帮忙做出来了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n怎么样？\n是不是觉得\n就是这样的感觉？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n这次\n之所以来到\n埃菲尔铁塔\n是为了拍摄\n明天日本博览会要用的\n照片！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n下午终于要开始彩排了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n不过……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n在那之前！\n午餐！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/004-773bc7cedd.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/004-773bc7cedd.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"661\"></a></figure>\n\nCitron果汁（现榨柠檬）虽然没喝，但分量就是这么多（笑）\n\n油封鸭肉和四季豆\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n来吧，\n既然补充了能量，\n我要加油去彩排了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">パリをモチーフにしたのが</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ミアレシティ</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ミアレシティの真ん中にあるのが</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">プリズムタワー！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">プリズムタワーの</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">モチーフは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">こちら！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/001-d39a299518.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/001-d39a299518.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nいまサッカーEURO2016開催中でボールがぶら下がってました！<br>\n\n\nあと奇跡的な鳩in（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/002-b7ff5c1d90.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/002-b7ff5c1d90.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n1段目の所に穴が空いているのは\n\nパリに初めて来た時に知ったこと！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/003-fcd631e48c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/003-fcd631e48c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n画像エフェクトかけなくても様々な表情を見せてくれる！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそう！\nエッフェル塔！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nフレグランスのボトルを\nイメージして\n美しく\nしなやかに\n光輝く\n美しいタワーを！\n\n<br>\n\n\nというオーダーをして\nデザイナーに作って貰いました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nどうでしょう？\nそんなイメージになっていると\n思いませんか？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今回\nエッフェル塔に来たのは\n明日のジャパンエキスポで使う\n写真撮影のため！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n午後からは\nいよいよリハーサル！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nと・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nその前に！\nランチ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/004-773bc7cedd.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4768508/004-773bc7cedd.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"661\"></a></figure>\n\nCitronジュース（レモン生絞り）飲んでないけどこの量（笑）\n\nConfit de canardとインゲン豆\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさあ \nパワー付いたので\nリハーサル\n頑張って来ます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}